ft;">&#8201;<font style="font-size: 10pt;">&#x2610;</font><font style="font-size: 10pt;"> Other</font></div><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: justify;">If &#8220;Other&#8221; has been checked in response to the previous question, indicate by check mark which financial statement item the Registrant has elected to follow.</div><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 1pt; margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#8201;<font style="font-size: 10pt;">&#x2610;</font><font style="font-size: 10pt;"> Item 17</font></div><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 1pt; margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#8201;<font style="font-size: 10pt;">&#x2610;</font><font style="font-size: 10pt;"> Item 18</font></div><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: justify;">If this is an annual report, indicate by check mark whether the Registrant is a shell company (as defined in Rule 12b-2 of the Exchange Act).</div><table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="txttab" style="margin-top: 4pt; border-collapse: collapse; width: 528pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr><td style="width: 48.86%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 6pt; padding-bottom: 3pt;"><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 1pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">&#8201;<font style="font-size: 10pt;">&#x2610;</font><font style="font-size: 10pt;"> Yes </font></div></td><td class="gutter" style="width: 1.14%; border-bottom: none; font-size: 2pt; padding-top: 6pt; padding-bottom: 3pt;">&#8203;</td><td class="gutter" style="width: 1.14%; border-bottom: none; font-size: 