;">The accompanying notes are an integral part of these combined carve-out financial statements.<br></div></div><div class="block-frill" style="width: 468pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 9.47pt; text-align: center;">F-6<br></div></div></div>
